From: Ada Lundhe <adalundhe@lundhe.audio>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 21:38:28 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] D189, PM M421: a DAX window's edge cases through real WHP
 guests. Short views and 64 KiB granules hold; a followed file's fault is
 taken for the guest's: these tests fail until the next commit

Six tests over a real partition, a real Window and Vcpu::run: a view shorter than its range at each place a file can end; a section ending within its range, refused and leaving it whole; a section viewed from each of a range's 32 granules and refused between them; several vCPUs at a mapping replaced 20,000 times; several at a file followed and cut. The last and a_range_followed_is_counted_before_the_lock_is_let_go fail here: on jupiter 2, 36 and 38 of a guest's accesses fell through as no device's in 6,400 followings (3 runs), and 3, 9 and 12 changes of 20,000 were seen with the count not moved.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
